            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> ### Contributing guidelines 贡献指南\r\n> * [x]  I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) 我已阅读 CONTRIBUTING.md\r\n> * [x]  I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md) 我已阅读 CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\r\n> \r\n> ### Module(s) 模块\r\n> mini.files 迷你文件\r\n> \r\n> ### Description 描述\r\n> When I open neovim like `nvim dotfiles/config/nvim` from the home directory `mini.files` opens like this当我从主目录 `nvim dotfiles/config/nvim` 打开neovim时 `mini.files` 像这样打开 ![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/63230301/253785985-a1c04794-74a2-4542-9d7b-739608c31b6d.png)\r\n> \r\n> But the next time `mini.nvim` is opened, it shows this但是下次打开 `mini.nvim` 时，它会显示这个 ![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/63230301/253785997-57a75379-c18b-4355-8294-b5c8015c640b.png)\r\n> \r\n> I used `nvim-tree` before and it changed the working directory to whichever folder was first opened and persisted. Can I have this feature in `mini.files` as well?我之前使用过 `nvim-tree` ，它将工作目录更改为首先打开并保留的文件夹。我也可以在 `mini.files` 中使用此功能吗？\r\n```lua\r\n    vim.keymap.set(\"n\", \"<leader>e\", \":lua MiniFiles.open(vim.api.nvim_buf_get_name(0))<CR>\", {noremap = true,\r\n        silent = true,})\r\n```\r\nmayme you can try keymap like this(?",
